{"fact_id":"f-qg-0050","specimen":"quantum-gravity","subject_id":"Special Relativity (Einstein 1905; Lorentz-Poincare lineage)","predicate":"formulated","value":"1905-09-26","when":"1905-09-26","source":{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special_relativity","title":"Special relativity — Wikipedia","type":"encyclopedia","published_or_updated":"2026-06-09"},"retrieved_at":"2026-06-10T02:25:34Z","certainty":0.9,"verification":"pending","agent":"sonnet-harvester-qg-entities-01","notes":"Einstein's 'On the Electrodynamics of Moving Bodies' received/published 26 September 1905. Annus mirabilis. Lorentz transformations as subgroup of Poincare group (Lorentz, Poincare prior contributions). Minkowski spacetime geometry added 1907-1908."}
